msgstr "`Quaternion::to_euler` 及其八个固定顺序的变体：分解为欧拉角"

#: manual/index.md:52
msgid "Several Euler-angle orders, the gimbal-lock branch and `pow_by_T` have known issues; the [API](api/core.md) marks each with a warning."
msgstr "若干欧拉角顺序、万向节锁分支与 `pow_by_T` 存在已知问题；[API](api/core.md) 用警告逐一标出。"

#: manual/index.md:54
msgid "Where to read next"
msgstr "接下来读什么"

#: manual/index.md:56
msgid "The [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md) rotates, composes, compares and interpolates orientations. The [core API](api/core.md) lists every function with its exact signature, conventions and edge cases, and the [core design](design/core.md) derives the Hamilton product, the rotation formula, division, slerp and the Euler-angle extraction from Hamilton's relations."
msgstr "[core 教程](tutorial/core.md)演示旋转、复合、比较与插值姿态。[core API](api/core.md) 列出每个函数的精确签名、约定与边界情况，[core 设计](design/core.md)则从 Hamilton 关系式推导 Hamilton 积、旋转公式、除法、slerp 与欧拉角提取。"

