#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "core tutorial"
msgstr "core 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "This tutorial gets you from an empty project to rotating vectors, composing and interpolating orientations, and converting them to Euler angles with `Luna-Flow/quaternion`. It ends with generic code over luna-generic traits and the mistakes that are easy to make. The mathematics is kept light here; the [core design](../design/core.md) derives it."
msgstr "本教程借助 `Luna-Flow/quaternion`，带你从空项目出发，完成向量旋转、姿态的复合与插值，以及与欧拉角之间的转换。最后介绍基于 luna-generic trait 的泛型代码以及容易犯的错误。这里尽量少讲数学；推导见 [core 设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:5
msgid "I want to"
msgstr "我想要"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:5
msgid "Use"
msgstr "使用"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:7
msgid "build a quaternion from its four components"
msgstr "由四个分量构造四元数"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:8
msgid "build the rotation by an angle around an axis"
msgstr "构造绕某轴旋转某角度的旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:9
msgid "rotate a 3D vector"
msgstr "旋转三维向量"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:9
msgid "`q.rotate(v)` with a unit `q`"
msgstr "对单位四元数 `q` 调用 `q.rotate(v)`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:10
msgid "apply `first`, then `second`"
msgstr "先应用 `first`，再应用 `second`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "undo a rotation"
msgstr "撤销一个旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "`q.conjugate()` (unit `q`) or `q.inv()`"
msgstr "`q.conjugate()`（单位 `q`）或 `q.inv()`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:12
msgid "find the rotation from `from` to `to`"
msgstr "求从 `from` 到 `to` 的旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "compare two orientations"
msgstr "比较两个姿态"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "`q.dot(r).abs()`, not `==`"
msgstr "`q.dot(r).abs()`，而不是 `==`"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:14
msgid "interpolate between orientations"
msgstr "在姿态之间插值"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:15
msgid "convert to or from Euler angles"
msgstr "与欧拉角互相转换"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:15
msgid "`from_euler` and `to_euler`, with the order named explicitly"
msgstr "`from_euler` 与 `to_euler`，并显式写出顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:16
msgid "keep a long product of rotations unit"
msgstr "让一长串旋转之积保持单位长度"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:17
msgid "write ring-generic code that accepts quaternions"
msgstr "编写接受四元数的环泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:17
msgid "a function with `R : @lf_alg.Ring`"
msgstr "带有 `R : @lf_alg.Ring` 的函数"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:19
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:21
msgid "Add the module to your project:"
msgstr "把模块加入项目："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:27
msgid "Import the package in your `moon.pkg`. The examples also use luna-generic (for generic code) and `moonbitlang/core/math` (for $\\pi$):"
msgstr "在 `moon.pkg` 中导入本包。示例还用到 luna-generic（用于泛型代码）与 `moonbitlang/core/math`（用于 $\\pi$）："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:37
msgid "The smallest useful program rotates the x axis by a quarter turn around the z axis:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序：把 x 轴绕 z 轴旋转四分之一圈："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:48
msgid "The x axis lands on the y axis, up to a rounding error of about $2 \\times 10^{-16}$ in the first coordinate."
msgstr "x 轴落在 y 轴上，第一个坐标有约 $2 \\times 10^{-16}$ 的舍入误差。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:50
msgid "Everyday tasks"
msgstr "日常任务"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:52
msgid "Build quaternions and multiply them"
msgstr "构造四元数并相乘"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:54
msgid "`Quaternion::from_vec((w, x, y, z))` builds $w + xi + yj + zk$. The usual operators work, and `*` is the Hamilton product. The basis units multiply like $ij = k$ but $ji = -k$, so the order of factors matters:"
msgstr "`Quaternion::from_vec((w, x, y, z))` 构造 $w + xi + yj + zk$。常用运算符都可使用，`*` 是 Hamilton 积。基元的乘法满足 $ij = k$ 而 $ji = -k$，因此因子顺序很重要："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:68
msgid "Integer components are exact, which makes `Quaternion[Int]` handy for checking identities. Use `Double` components for rotations."
msgstr "整数分量是精确的，这使 `Quaternion[Int]` 很适合验证恒等式。旋转请使用 `Double` 分量。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:70
msgid "Rotate vectors and compose rotations"
msgstr "旋转向量并复合旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:72
msgid "`from_axis_angle(axis, angle)` gives the unit quaternion of a rotation, and `rotate` applies it to a 3D vector. To apply `first` and then `second`, multiply them as `second * first`, like matrices acting on column vectors:"
msgstr "`from_axis_angle(axis, angle)` 给出旋转的单位四元数，`rotate` 把它作用于三维向量。若要先施加 `first` 再施加 `second`，就像矩阵作用于列向量那样，将它们相乘为 `second * first`："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:87
msgid "`rotate` assumes a unit quaternion. Quaternions built by `from_axis_angle` are unit; call `normalize()` on anything you assembled yourself."
msgstr "`rotate` 假定输入为单位四元数。`from_axis_angle` 构造的四元数是单位的；自行拼装的四元数请先调用 `normalize()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:89
msgid "Undo a rotation and find the rotation between two orientations"
msgstr "撤销旋转，以及求两个姿态之间的旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:91
msgid "The inverse of a unit quaternion is its conjugate. To find the rotation `delta` that takes orientation `from` to orientation `to` (so that `delta * from == to`), divide on the right: `to / from` is $to \\cdot from^{-1}$. `left_div` solves the other equation, `from * x == to`, which gives the rotation expressed in the frame of `from`:"
msgstr "单位四元数的逆就是它的共轭。要求把姿态 `from` 转到姿态 `to` 的旋转 `delta`（即 `delta * from == to`），在右侧做除法：`to / from` 即 $to \\cdot from^{-1}$。`left_div` 求解另一个方程 `from * x == to`，得到在 `from` 坐标系中表示的旋转："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:106
msgid "Compare two rotations"
msgstr "比较两个旋转"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:108
msgid "`q` and `-q` describe the same rotation, so `==` is the wrong test for \"same orientation\". For unit quaternions, $|q \\cdot r| = \\cos(\\theta/2)$ where $\\theta$ is the angle between the two orientations:"
msgstr "`q` 与 `-q` 表示同一个旋转，因此 `==` 不适合用来判断“姿态相同”。对单位四元数，$|q \\cdot r| = \\cos(\\theta/2)$，其中 $\\theta$ 为两个姿态之间的夹角："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:129
msgid "Interpolate between orientations"
msgstr "在姿态之间插值"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:131
msgid "`slerp(q1, q2, t)` moves along the shortest great-circle arc at constant angular speed:"
msgstr "`slerp(q1, q2, t)` 以恒定角速度沿最短的大圆弧运动："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:146
msgid "The x axis turns by $22.5^\\circ$ per step, as constant angular speed promises."
msgstr "x 轴每步转过 $22.5^\\circ$，正如恒定角速度所保证的那样。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:148
msgid "Convert to and from Euler angles"
msgstr "与欧拉角相互转换"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:150
msgid "`from_euler(roll, pitch, yaw)` uses the order `\"XYZ\"` by default, which is $q_X(\\text{roll})\\,q_Y(\\text{pitch})\\,q_Z(\\text{yaw})$: intrinsic rotations about X, then the new Y, then the new Z. The matching inverse is `to_euler(order=\"XYZ\", external=false)`. The default of `to_euler` is a different convention, extrinsic Z-Y-X, which returns the same three angles in reverse order:"
msgstr "`from_euler(roll, pitch, yaw)` 默认使用顺序 `\"XYZ\"`，即 $q_X(\\text{roll})\\,q_Y(\\text{pitch})\\,q_Z(\\text{yaw})$：先绕 X、再绕新的 Y、最后绕新的 Z 的内旋。对应的逆为 `to_euler(order=\"XYZ\", external=false)`。`to_euler` 的默认值是另一种约定——外旋 Z-Y-X，它以相反顺序返回同样的三个角："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:164
msgid "The k-th angle returned by `to_euler` always belongs to the k-th axis of `order`. Read the [API notes](../api/core.md#quaterniontoeuler) before using other orders: some combinations have known issues."
msgstr "`to_euler` 返回的第 k 个角总是属于 `order` 的第 k 个轴。使用其他顺序前请先阅读 [API 说明](../api/core.md#quaterniontoeuler)：部分组合存在已知问题。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:166
msgid "Read the components back"
msgstr "读取分量"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:168
msgid "`Quaternion` is abstract and has no field accessors. The dot product with a basis quaternion reads one component, and `Debug` shows all four:"
msgstr "`Quaternion` 是抽象类型，没有字段访问器。与基四元数做点积可以读出一个分量，`Debug` 则显示全部四个分量："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:184
msgid "For finite components the dot product with a basis quaternion returns the component exactly."
msgstr "对有限的分量，与基四元数的点积会精确返回该分量。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:186
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "进阶"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:188
msgid "Generic code over luna-generic traits"
msgstr "基于 luna-generic trait 的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:190
msgid "`Quaternion[T]` implements luna-generic's `Ring` whenever `T` does, so ring-generic algorithms accept quaternions. This function computes $x^n$ by repeated squaring for any `Ring`:"
msgstr "只要 `T` 实现了 luna-generic 的 `Ring`，`Quaternion[T]` 也实现它，因此环上的泛型算法接受四元数。下面的函数对任意 `Ring` 用反复平方计算 $x^n$："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:211
msgid "Quaternions are not a `Field`, so algorithms that require `Field` (and may assume $ab = ba$) do not accept them. That is deliberate; the [design page](../design/core.md#why-ring-and-not-field) explains why."
msgstr "四元数不是 `Field`，因此要求 `Field`（并可能假定 $ab = ba$）的算法不接受它们。这是有意为之；原因见[设计页面](../design/core.md#why-ring-and-not-field)。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:213
msgid "Exact identities over `Int`"
msgstr "`Int` 上的精确恒等式"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:215
msgid "Exact components make the norm identity $|pq|^2 = |p|^2|q|^2$ checkable without rounding. Over `Int` it is Euler's four-square identity: a product of two sums of four squares is again a sum of four squares, and the Hamilton product tells you which one:"
msgstr "精确的分量使范数恒等式 $|pq|^2 = |p|^2|q|^2$ 可以在没有舍入的情况下验证。在 `Int` 上它就是欧拉四平方恒等式：两个四平方和之积仍是四平方和，而 Hamilton 积告诉你是哪一个："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:227
msgid "Functions that need square roots or trigonometry (`magnitude`, `normalize`, `inv`'s division, `slerp`, Euler conversions) truncate over `Int`; keep `Int` for ring arithmetic."
msgstr "需要平方根或三角函数的函数（`magnitude`、`normalize`、`inv` 中的除法、`slerp`、欧拉角转换）在 `Int` 上会截断；请把 `Int` 留给环运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:229
msgid "Long chains of rotations"
msgstr "长的旋转链"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:231
msgid "Every Hamilton product in `Double` rounds, so the norm of a product of many unit quaternions drifts away from 1, by at most about $n \\cdot 10^{-15}$ after $n$ products and usually much less. `rotate` assumes a unit quaternion, so a drifted one rotates vectors slightly too far or not far enough. Renormalize now and then:"
msgstr "`Double` 中的每次 Hamilton 积都有舍入，因此许多单位四元数之积的范数会偏离 1，$n$ 次乘积后至多约偏离 $n \\cdot 10^{-15}$，通常远小于此。`rotate` 假定四元数为单位长度，因此漂移后的四元数会把向量转得略多或略少。请不时重新归一化："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:247
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:249
msgid "All operations work on four scalars and run in constant time, except `pow_by_int`, which uses $O(\\log n)$ multiplications. `q.rotate(v)` costs two cross products and is cheaper than computing `q * v * q.inv()` with full Hamilton products. Every function returns a new value; nothing is mutated."
msgstr "所有运算都作用于四个标量并在常数时间内完成，只有 `pow_by_int` 需要 $O(\\log n)$ 次乘法。`q.rotate(v)` 的代价是两次叉积，比用完整的 Hamilton 积计算 `q * v * q.inv()` 更便宜。每个函数都返回新值，不修改任何东西。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:251
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:253
msgid "**`/` changed in 0.2.0.** `q / r` is now $q\\,r^{-1}$ (right division). Code written for 0.1.x that relied on `/` computing $r^{-1} q$ must call `q.left_div(r)`."
msgstr "**`/` 在 0.2.0 中改变了含义。** `q / r` 现在是 $q\\,r^{-1}$（右除）。为 0.1.x 编写、依赖 `/` 计算 $r^{-1} q$ 的代码必须改用 `q.left_div(r)`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:254
msgid "**Order of factors.** `a * b` rotates by `b` first. Swapping the factors gives a different rotation unless both turn about the same axis."
msgstr "**因子顺序。** `a * b` 先按 `b` 旋转。交换因子会得到不同的旋转，除非两者绕同一轴转动。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:255
msgid "**Non-unit quaternions in `rotate`.** `rotate` does not normalize. For a non-unit $q$ its formula is not $q v q^{-1}$, and the result generally does not even have the length of the input. Normalize first."
msgstr "**`rotate` 中的非单位四元数。** `rotate` 不做归一化。对非单位的 $q$，其公式并不是 $q v q^{-1}$，结果通常连长度都与输入不同。请先归一化。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:256
msgid "**`==` on rotations.** `q` and `-q` are the same rotation but unequal values. Floating-point results rarely compare equal anyway; compare with a tolerance."
msgstr "**对旋转使用 `==`。** `q` 与 `-q` 是同一个旋转，但值不相等。浮点结果本来也很少完全相等；请按容差比较。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:257
msgid "**Division by zero.** `inv`, `/` and `left_div` divide by $|r|^2$. A zero quaternion gives NaN components over `Double` and a runtime trap over `Int`. `normalize` and `pow_by_T` return the zero quaternion unchanged."
msgstr "**除以零。** `inv`、`/` 与 `left_div` 都会除以 $|r|^2$。零四元数在 `Double` 上得到 NaN 分量，在 `Int` 上触发运行时陷阱。`normalize` 与 `pow_by_T` 会原样返回零四元数。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:258
msgid "**`Int` components and transcendental functions.** `magnitude`, `normalize`, `inv` and friends truncate over `Int`; `inv` of anything but a unit is zero."
msgstr "**`Int` 分量与超越函数。** `magnitude`、`normalize`、`inv` 等在 `Int` 上会截断；除单位元外，任何四元数的 `inv` 都为零。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:259
msgid "**Euler conventions.** `from_euler` defaults to `\"XYZ\"` and `to_euler` to extrinsic `\"ZYX\"`. Name both explicitly. Avoid `from_euler` with `\"ZYX\"` or `\"YZX\"`, `to_euler` with `\"XZY\"` extrinsic or `\"YZX\"` intrinsic, and results near gimbal lock ($|\\text{pitch}| \\approx 90^\\circ$), which have known issues listed in the [API](../api/core.md#quaterniontoeuler). Near gimbal lock `to_euler` also prints a warning line to standard output."
msgstr "**欧拉角约定。** `from_euler` 默认为 `\"XYZ\"`，`to_euler` 默认为外旋 `\"ZYX\"`。请显式写出两者。避免使用 `\"ZYX\"` 或 `\"YZX\"` 的 `from_euler`、外旋 `\"XZY\"` 或内旋 `\"YZX\"` 的 `to_euler`，以及接近万向节锁（$|\\text{pitch}| \\approx 90^\\circ$）的结果，这些都有 [API](../api/core.md#quaterniontoeuler) 中列出的已知问题。接近万向节锁时，`to_euler` 还会向标准输出打印一行警告。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:260
msgid "**Fractional powers.** `pow_by_T` is wrong for quaternions with a negative scalar part (negate the quaternion first when it represents a rotation), and it can return NaN for pure quaternions ($w = 0$)."
msgstr "**分数次幂。** 对标量部为负的四元数，`pow_by_T` 的结果是错误的（当它表示旋转时，请先对其取负）；对纯四元数（$w = 0$）它还可能返回 NaN。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:261
msgid "**Extreme exponents.** `pow_by_int(-2147483648)` never returns; the smallest `Int` has no positive counterpart."
msgstr "**极端指数。** `pow_by_int(-2147483648)` 永不返回；最小的 `Int` 没有对应的正数。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:262
msgid "**Own component types.** `DoubleConvert` is not open for implementation outside this package, so only `Int` and `Double` work with the functions that need it."
msgstr "**自定义分量类型。** `DoubleConvert` 不允许在本包之外实现，因此只有 `Int` 与 `Double` 能用于需要它的函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:264
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续阅读"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:266
msgid "The [core API](../api/core.md) lists every function with its exact signature and edge cases."
msgstr "[core API](../api/core.md) 列出了每个函数的精确签名与边界情况。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:267
msgid "The [core design](../design/core.md) derives the Hamilton product, the rotation formula, slerp and the Euler-angle extraction."
msgstr "[core 设计](../design/core.md) 推导了 Hamilton 积、旋转公式、slerp 与欧拉角提取。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:268
msgid "[luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) defines the `Ring`, `Inverse` and `Conjugate` traits used here."
msgstr "[luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 定义了这里用到的 `Ring`、`Inverse` 与 `Conjugate` trait。"

#~ msgid "This page lists every public item of the package `Luna-Flow/quaternion` (source root `src`), grouped by purpose. The [generated interface](../../../src/pkg.generated.mbti) is the authority for signatures. The examples import the package under its default alias `@quaternion` and luna-generic as `@lf_alg`:"
#~ msgstr "本页按用途分组列出包 `Luna-Flow/quaternion`（源码根目录 `src`）的全部公开项。签名以[生成的接口文件](../../../src/pkg.generated.mbti)为准。示例以默认别名 `@quaternion` 导入本包，并以 `@lf_alg` 导入 luna-generic："

#~ msgid "The mathematics behind the operations is derived in the [core design](../design/core.md); the [core tutorial](../tutorial/core.md) walks through typical tasks."
#~ msgstr "各运算背后的数学推导见 [core 设计](../design/core.md)；[core 教程](../tutorial/core.md)则演示常见任务。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Known issue: `pow_by_T` recovers the angle as $\\varphi = \\arcsin|\\hat{\\mathbf v}|$, which lies in $[0, \\pi/2]$. It is wrong when the scalar part is negative ($\\varphi > \\pi/2$): the function then uses $\\pi - \\varphi$, so for example `q.pow_by_T(1.0)` returns `q` with the sign of its scalar part flipped. Use `pow_by_int` for integer exponents, and negate `q` first (which does not change the rotation) when you need fractional powers of a rotation with a negative scalar part."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 已知问题：`pow_by_T` 以 $\\varphi = \\arcsin|\\hat{\\mathbf v}|$ 求角，其值落在 $[0, \\pi/2]$。当标量部为负（$\\varphi > \\pi/2$）时结果错误：此时函数使用的是 $\\pi - \\varphi$，例如 `q.pow_by_T(1.0)` 会返回标量部符号被翻转的 `q`。整数指数请使用 `pow_by_int`；若需要标量部为负的旋转的分数次幂，请先对 `q` 取负（这不改变旋转）。"

#~ msgid "In the gimbal-lock branch the returned angles do not reproduce the input rotation: the first angle is computed from a formula that does not isolate the remaining degree of freedom. Treat results with $|b| \\approx \\pi/2$ as unreliable."
#~ msgstr "在万向节锁分支中，返回的角不能复现输入的旋转：第一个角所用的公式没有分离出剩余的自由度。请把 $|b| \\approx \\pi/2$ 时的结果视为不可靠。"

#~ msgid "`slerp` falls back to normalized linear interpolation when $\\cos\\Omega > 0.9995$, that is $\\Omega < 0.0316$ rad. There $\\sin\\Omega < 0.032$, and dividing by it would amplify rounding errors in the weights; the linear path, on the other hand, deviates from the arc by less than $5.1 \\times 10^{-7}$ rad on $S^3$ (about $10^{-6}$ rad of rotation angle) at the threshold, and less below it."
#~ msgstr "当 $\\cos\\Omega > 0.9995$，即 $\\Omega < 0.0316$ rad 时，`slerp` 退回归一化线性插值。此时 $\\sin\\Omega < 0.032$，除以它会放大权重中的舍入误差；而在阈值处，线性路径与圆弧在 $S^3$ 上的偏差小于 $5.1 \\times 10^{-7}$ rad（约合旋转角 $10^{-6}$ rad），低于阈值时更小。"

#~ msgid "The gimbal-lock branch of the Euler extraction does not isolate the free angle (see above), and it reports the warning with `println`."
#~ msgstr "欧拉角提取的万向节锁分支没有分离出自由角（见上文），并用 `println` 输出警告。"

#~ msgid "`pow_by_T` computes $\\varphi$ with `asin`, which cannot exceed $\\pi/2$; $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\lvert\\mathbf u\\rvert, w)$ would cover $[0, \\pi]$."
#~ msgstr "`pow_by_T` 用 `asin` 计算 $\\varphi$，其值不超过 $\\pi/2$；改用 $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\lvert\\mathbf u\\rvert, w)$ 即可覆盖 $[0, \\pi]$。"

